sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Route
    participant JWTMiddleware as JWT Middleware
    participant SecurityUtils as Security Utils
    participant UserRepo as UserRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Service as Protected Service

    User->>+Frontend: Request protected resource<br/>(e.g., GET /auth/me)
    Frontend->>+API: GET /protected-endpoint<br/>Header: Authorization: Bearer {token}
    
    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over API,SecurityUtils: Step 1: Extract & Validate Token
        API->>+JWTMiddleware: Dependency: get_current_user(token)
        
        JWTMiddleware->>+SecurityUtils: verify_token(token)
        
        SecurityUtils->>SecurityUtils: jwt.decode(token,<br/>SECRET_KEY,<br/>algorithms=["HS256"])
        
        alt Token expired
            SecurityUtils-->>JWTMiddleware: JWTError("Token expired")
            JWTMiddleware-->>API: HTTPException(401,<br/>"Token expired")
            API-->>Frontend: 401 Unauthorized
            Frontend-->>User: Session expired,<br/>please log in
        end
        
        alt Token invalid
            SecurityUtils-->>JWTMiddleware: JWTError("Invalid token")
            JWTMiddleware-->>API: HTTPException(401,<br/>"Invalid credentials")
            API-->>Frontend: 401 Unauthorized
            Frontend-->>User: Invalid session,<br/>please log in
        end
        
        SecurityUtils->>SecurityUtils: Extract payload:<br/>{sub: user_id, exp: timestamp}
        SecurityUtils-->>-JWTMiddleware: Decoded payload
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over JWTMiddleware,DB: Step 2: Verify User Exists
        JWTMiddleware->>+UserRepo: get_user_by_id(user_id)
        UserRepo->>+DB: SELECT * FROM users<br/>WHERE id = ?
        DB-->>-UserRepo: User or None
        UserRepo-->>-JWTMiddleware: UserDTO or None
        
        alt User not found
            JWTMiddleware-->>API: HTTPException(401,<br/>"User not found")
            API-->>Frontend: 401 Unauthorized
            Frontend-->>User: Account not found
        end
        
        alt User not verified
            JWTMiddleware-->>API: HTTPException(403,<br/>"Email not verified")
            API-->>Frontend: 403 Forbidden
            Frontend-->>User: Please verify your email
        end
        
        JWTMiddleware-->>-API: Authenticated UserDTO
    end
    
    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over API,Service: Step 3: Execute Protected Logic
        API->>+Service: Execute business logic<br/>with authenticated user
        Service->>Service: Process request with user context
        Service-->>-API: Response data
    end
    
    API-->>-Frontend: 200 OK<br/>{data}
    Frontend-->>-User: Display protected resource
    
    Note over User,API: Token valid for 24 hours<br/>Contains: user_id, expiration<br/>Algorithm: HS256
